<title>USA: Central Reserve chairman exercises option.</title>
<headline>Central Reserve chairman exercises option.</headline>
<dateline>STRONGSVILLE, Ohio 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Reserve Life Corp said Tuesday its chairman, Fred Lick Jr, has exercised an option to buy 50,000 common shares of the company.</p>
<p>The purchase adds to Lick's stake in Central Reserve and increases his position as the largest holder of its common shares, the company said.</p>
<p>The company did not provide details.</p>
<p>Central Reserve is the parent of Central Reserve Life Insurance Co.</p>
</text>
